            "body": "Yeah, this is a side effect of d1f7e95257e7. It is not an issue in case of using some \"dashboard\" type of plugin (like 'mini.starter'), so was overlooked.\r\nI'll take a look if this is feasible to adjust.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nDo you mind sharing why you've closed this?",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yeah, this is a side effect of <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/commit/d1f7e95257e770c5d79008b5d7b1f526bb95178d/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/commit/d1f7e95257e770c5d79008b5d7b1f526bb95178d\"><tt>d1f7e95</tt></a>. It is not an issue in case of using some \"dashboard\" type of plugin (like 'mini.starter'), so was overlooked.<br>\nI'll take a look if this is feasible to adjust.</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Do you mind sharing why you've closed this?</p>",
